# The build context of deploy/Dockerfile.* (Adım 26). Everything an image needs is under src/ and
# web/; this keeps out build output, dependencies, and every development secret — user secrets
# never live in the repository, but appsettings.Development.json and .env do on a developer's disk.

# Build output and dependencies, rebuilt inside the image.
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/node_modules/
web/dist/

# Development secrets and per-machine settings.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/secrets.json
**/appsettings.*.json
**/*.user
**/launchSettings.json

# Not part of any image.
.git/
.github/
.vs/
.claude/
tests/
demo/
tools/
deploy/
docker-compose*.yml
*.md
